      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Diagnosis and risk stratification in angina pectoris is supported on clinical evaluation, rest electrocardiogram, exercise stress test and coronary angiography. Use and timing application of that diagnostic methods depend on coronary artery disease prevalence and on clinical situation. This review describe diagnostic and prognostic value of the tests in angina pectoris."},
